# Benchmark: HTTP client
# Workload: 50 GET requests to a local Otter web server (benchmarks/http/
# server.ot, started by the runner) and a check of each answer. Measures the
# console HTTP client's request path, not the network.

answers is 0
repeat 50 times
    get "http://localhost:47392/ping" into res
    if res is "pong"
        answers is answers plus 1
    .
.
say "http answers" answers
